  "bodyHash": "Lq5H/K1zC+Y=",
  "content": "你好世界<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/OVV5lXk.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8ZhXRQ4.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Available%20for%20Minecraft-1.19%20%7C%201.16%20%7C%201.14%20%7C%201.12%20%7C%201.11%20%7C%201.1%20%7C%201.9-ecebe6?labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge\" width=\"524\" height=\"28\" />&emsp;<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Install%20on-Client%20Only-ecebe6?labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge\" width=\"210\" height=\"28\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-animations-collection/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=2020709689%3A7498\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3yrSsw7\" width=\"320\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puzzles-lib\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3jr9xQw\" width=\"215\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-animations-collection/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=2020709689%3A7499\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3nRXr4m\" width=\"325\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/30lZmFY\" width=\"208\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puzzles-lib\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3jr9xQw\" width=\"215\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forge-config-api-port-fabric\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3clkhvn\" width=\"299\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8ZhXRQ4.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong>📖 關於：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>更好的動畫合輯</strong>旨在透過改變遊戲中的模型，實現更佳動畫與細微效果，以提升Minecraft的氛圍。它試圖為遊戲中能受益的部分帶來更真實的感受，例如模擬物理效果，以及讓原本不會動的模型部件產生動作。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8ZhXRQ4.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong>📚 內容：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>蠕動的惡魂觸手</strong>將惡魂觸手分成多個部分，讓它們像電影裡常見的觸手怪物那樣逼真地扭動。雖然看起來更嚇人，但終究也更賞心悅目。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>扭動的魷魚觸手</strong>為魷魚的游泳動畫添加類似水母的效果。同時也讓它們在移動時觸手更流暢地飄動。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>頑皮狗</strong>讓狼的尾巴更蓬鬆、更具流動感，在站立和奔跑時會逼真地搖擺。同時也使被馴服的狼能以趴臥取代坐下。拿著肉塊時，它們甚至會翻身打滾。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>流暢豹貓尾</strong>移除了現有豹貓硬邦邦的棒狀尾巴，取而代之的是更優美的模樣。完全動畫化的流暢尾巴，在站立或奔跑時都會隨之擺動。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>捲曲貓尾</strong>將豹貓引以為傲的美麗流暢尾巴動畫也帶給了貓咪。這還不是全部——當貓咪坐下時，尾巴甚至會環繞身體！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>哼哼豬</strong>添加了一個非常細微的動畫：當豬發出哼哼聲時，牠們的鼻子會跟著動。雖然只是極其輕微的上下移動，但確實存在。為你的家畜增添一絲生氣。別忘了那飄動的耳朵！對這麼小的動物來說可真不小。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>搖晃牛乳房</strong>讓牛的乳房在行走時搖晃。同時也使乳房上出現乳頭，但若對此感到不適，可以將其關閉。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>咯咯雞</strong>讓雞在咯咯叫時張闔鳥喙。鳥喙也變得更加纖細，從此不再雞鴨不分！當牠們昂首闊步時，頭部會前後晃動，鳥喙下的垂肉搖擺，翅膀也會輕微拍動。就像真的一樣！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>蠕動村民鼻子</strong>做了個細微改動：每當村民發出獨特的「嗯～」聲時，他們的大鼻子就會微微扭動！這是個小變化，但誰看了不會會心一笑呢？</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>蠕動鐵魔像鼻子</strong>和上面完全相同，只是對象換成了鐵魔像！由於鐵魔像不會發出聲音，它們的鼻子會在受傷時扭動。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>顫動液態史萊姆</strong>帶來了令人愉悅的視覺變化：讓史萊姆的內部像液體一樣流動。跳躍時更會濺起水花。眼睛、嘴巴以及核心本身都會獨立移動。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>岩漿立方漢堡</strong>為岩漿立方加入了自訂死亡動畫，死亡時身體會堆疊成一堆熱騰騰、美味的漢堡肉餅。可惜的是，因為太燙，你無法食用它們。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>蜘蛛膝蓋</strong>是一項真正令人驚豔的視覺補充。蜘蛛現在終於擁有牠們夢寐以求的膝蓋了。洞穴蜘蛛也同樣受惠。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>搖擺苦力怕</strong>喚起了人們對當年由獨一無二的<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCshoKvlZGZ20rVgazZp5vnQ\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">CaptainSparklez</span></a>創作的<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k2rDbRUDkds\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">超受歡迎音樂影片</span></a>的回憶。還記得那隻超可愛的搖擺苦力怕嗎？嗯，現在它已經在遊戲中了。完整的模樣，真實還原，和影片一模一樣。這可能是整個合輯中最好的自訂動畫。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>揮臂終界使者</strong>讓憤怒的終界使者在追逐目標時瘋狂揮舞手臂。非常符合它們扭曲的本性：狂亂擺動的充氣揮臂終界使者！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>動畫雪人手臂</strong>讓雪人在丟雪球時手臂會擺動。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>跪地羊</strong>相當酷。讓羊在吃草時真正彎下身體。不再只是低垂頭部，而是整個身體壓低，以便品嚐那鮮美的纖維素。你有注意到它們跪下時膝蓋也會彎曲嗎？</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>熟悉馬</strong>讓馬再次變得更有活力，就像舊版本那樣。做法是恢復牠們的嘴巴和膝蓋，同時忠於原版模型風格。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>吐痰羊駝</strong>讓羊駝在吐口水時張開嘴巴。以前牠們到底是怎麼做到的？！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>彎曲人形膝蓋</strong>讓殭屍類和豬布林類生物的膝蓋在行走時彎曲。看起來非常流暢且漂亮。相信我，你一定會喜歡。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8ZhXRQ4.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong>📷 媒體：</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/383/889/2021-07-29_11.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\" /></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/376/50/2021-06-30_14.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\" /></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>咯咯雞</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><strong>跪地羊</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/383/756/2021-07-28_21.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\" /></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/382/106/2021-07-22_13.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\" /></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>哼哼豬</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><strong>搖晃牛乳房</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/383/201/2021-07-26_16.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\" /></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/383/202/2021-07-26_16.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\" /></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>熟悉馬</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><strong>吐痰羊駝</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/383/193/2021-07-26_16.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\" /></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/382/111/2021-07-22_12.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\" /></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>蠕動村民鼻子</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><strong>蠕動鐵魔像鼻子</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/382/110/2021-07-22_13.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\" /></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/382/109/2021-07-22_13.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\" /></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>捲曲貓尾</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><strong>流暢豹貓尾</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/383/196/2021-07-26_16.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\" /></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/382/107/2021-07-22_12.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\" /></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>頑皮狗</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><strong>動畫雪人手臂</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/382/108/2021-07-22_13.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\" /></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/383/190/2021-07-26_16.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\" /></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>蜘蛛膝蓋</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><strong>顫動液態史萊姆</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/383/757/2021-07-26_16.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\" /></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/383/758/2021-07-28_09.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\" /></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>揮臂終界使者</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><strong>搖擺苦力怕</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/374/725/2021-06-25_13.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\" /></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/383/200/2021-07-26_16.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\" /></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>扭動的魷魚觸手</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><strong>彎曲人形膝蓋</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/374/728/2021-06-25_13.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\" /></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/383/192/2021-07-26_16.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\" /></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>蠕動的惡魂觸手</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><strong>岩漿立方漢堡</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/aQKmdRYwvGk?wmode=transparent\" height=\"231\" width=\"410\"></iframe></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/S3oko18JERQ?wmode=transparent\" height=\"231\" width=\"410\"></iframe></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>預告片 by <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCEq5O5WCb2tTngspsMsyrrQ\">Loook's</a></strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><strong>評測 by <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC7SktcUK2OPYQwe123rJVbg\">JKapGaming</a></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/BS0OOQJ5jQw?wmode=transparent\" height=\"231\" width=\"410\"></iframe></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/3I7i7oENjFI?wmode=transparent\" height=\"231\" width=\"410\"></iframe></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>評測 by <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCyZA5Ysa33gA89sCdWJQojQ\">CavemanFilms</a></strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><strong>評測 by <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCKlhpmbHGxBE6uw9B_uLeqQ\">Sky Does Everything</a></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/JGk4mXX6QQc?wmode=transparent\" height=\"231\" width=\"410\"></iframe></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/qkFSPBTdqXA?wmode=transparent\" height=\"231\" width=\"410\"></iframe></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>評測 by <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCH-_hzb2ILSCo9ftVSnrCIQ\">YOGSCAST Lewis &amp; Simon</a></strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><strong>評測 by <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCshoKvlZGZ20rVgazZp5vnQ\">CaptainSparklez</a></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/SEqjHrJlYy4?wmode=transparent\" height=\"231\" width=\"410\"></iframe></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/4DYa_7KAdd8?wmode=transparent\" height=\"231\" width=\"410\"></iframe></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>評測 by <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCS5Oz6CHmeoF7vSad0qqXfw\">DanTDM</a></strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><strong>評測 by <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCqg2eLFNUu3QN3dttNeOWkw\">iHasCupquake</a></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8ZhXRQ4.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong>💡 常見問題：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>問：如何配置這個模組？</strong><br /><strong>答：</strong>安裝我的<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>Config Menus for Forge</strong></span></a>模組，然後直接在遊戲中進行設定！</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>問：這個模組能與自訂資源包搭配使用嗎？</strong><br /><strong>答：</strong>可以！更好的動畫合輯中的所有內容都基於原版資源構建，沒有使用任何額外的紋理。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8ZhXRQ4.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong>🏆 致謝：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">更好的動畫合輯的開發得到了以下人士的幫助與啟發：</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://www.minecraftforum.net/members/KodaichiZero\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>KodaichiZero</strong></span></a> 基本上獲得所有功勞，因為他在多年前為 Minecraft 1.2.5 創作了原始的<a href=\"https://www.minecraftforum.net/forums/mapping-and-modding-java-edition/minecraft-mods/1284100-1-2-5-the-better-animations-collection\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">更好的動畫合輯</span></a>中的這些驚人模型與動畫。繼續進行此項目的書面許可可在<a href=\"https://i.imgur.com/D7CiEnf.png\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">此處</span></a>找到。</span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/tr9zw\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>Tr9zw</strong></span></a> 啟發了物品檢查動畫的部分內容，靈感來自他們的作品<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/not-enough-animations\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Not Enough Animations</span></a>模組</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/almightytallestred\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>Almightytallestred</strong></span></a> 啟發了進食動畫的部分內容，靈感來自他們的作品<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/player-eating-animation\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Player Eating Animation</span></a>模組</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/freshlx_official\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>FreshLX</strong></span></a> 啟發了飄動豬耳朵的設計，靈感來自他們的作品<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fresh-animations\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Fresh Animations</span></a>資源包</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://mcpedl.com/user/trayblock/\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>TrayBlock</strong></span></a> 啟發了纖細雞喙的設計，靈感來自他們的作品<a href=\"https://mcpedl.com/improved-vanilla-mobs\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Improved Vanilla Mobs</span></a>附加內容</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8ZhXRQ4.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/lunapixelstudios/projects\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=CurseForge&amp;message=LunaPixelStudios&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"282\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://twitter.com/LunaPixelStudio\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/LunaPixelStudio?label=Twitter&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=twitter&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"149\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/8ZmhaPPbjE\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790272037578473512?label=Discord&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"220\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1MOyd2u.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"300\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_/projects\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Fuzs_&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"97\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Fuzss&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"97\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC2l26SuCmCNSCPefpfbCX7Q\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Fuzs&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"89\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://twitter.com/Fusseel\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=@Fusseel&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=twitter&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"124\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/user/Fusseel\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=u/Fusseel&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=reddit&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"Reddit\" width=\"130\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Fuzs%200212&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"127\" height=\"28\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8ZhXRQ4.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<table style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/kiHP8s9.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-magic\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Mlxi8cy.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/trading-post\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/UzgNFIB.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pick-up-notifier\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DCwxKZU.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/console-experience\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/aXWOS7B.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stylish-effects\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fmWwWkZ.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/visual-workbench\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DTzDrbm.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/diagonal-fences\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mU9OlhP.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/golden-age-combat\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sHiR309.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/air-hop\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MinxlVJ.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8ZhXRQ4.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>",
